3", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120757920", "personaname": "I'm Hopped on MountinDew", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198120757920/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3071, "last_played": 1731614191, "avatar": "543bb32f9249e6738288c0d3ac6987ee25983c41"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game GG", "timestamp_created": 1594841930, "timestamp_updated": 1594841930, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "72745158", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139268523", "personaname": "Cookie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cookiekuma/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 2553, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 741, "last_played": 1605556118, "avatar": "a748dcf954afbe060ce1dd2553c2e920b84eb25a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun and complete experience. Not great for multiplayer as you need port forwarding or Hamachi. The logbook for items is not as intuitive as the one in the sequel is but I do especially enjoy the artwork in the monster logs. The item logs are definitely more interesting in the sequel though. Risk of Rain 2 and the original are different games but do share very enjoyable core mechanics and if you are familiar with one, picking up the other won't be too hard. In my case, I never got super into the first but after playing the second I was able to understand it more and get more enjoyment out of this one.\n\nThe game can be pretty jank on PC. Steam integration is weird, can't seem to take screenshots with F12 (no feedback, and for some reason they picked that button for fast scrolling through the credits?) and cannot close it through the Steam \"close\" button (I always have to use Task Manager to shut it down if I'm not using the in-game quit button).", "timestamp_created": 1594836473, "timestamp_updated": 1595532331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "72739562", "author": {"steamid": "76561198804042454", "personaname": "Diskman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheDiskman/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 425, "last_played": 1671925829, "avatar": "16b8b4651ea0c4004107059b38cc0306a4a05b7a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good and hard.", "timestamp_created": 1594829024, "timestamp_updated": 1594829024, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}